"language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"Jim Knopf und die Wilde 13","overview":{"value":"Nuove avventure attendono Jim Bottone e il macchinista Lukas. Dopo che i due hanno sconfitto il Drago Dorato della Saggezza, la banda dei Tredici Pirati è alla ricerca di vendetta. Con le loro locomotive Emma e Molly, Jim e Lukas intraprendono un viaggio pericoloso durante il quale Jim potrebbe finalmente vedere avverato il suo desiderio di scoprire le proprie origini.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2020-10-01","status":"Released","rating":5.9,"ratingCount":64,"genres":["Avventura","Famiglia","Fantasy"],"countries":["Germany"],"facts":{"Runtime":"110m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":38300,"name":"Henning Baum","role":"Lukas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e5CkswOQ3YVdH9nCoaouxOnUgxd.jpg"},{"id":1699430,"name":"Solomon Gordon","role":"Jim Knopf","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v8ssd9ggLUTk6OSLLr9uzAPH04B.jpg"},{"id":207598,"name":"Annette Frier","role":"Mrs. Waas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cGK4GAlApjjtpeaXS7EfSTQ6PO2.jpg"},{"id":24440,"name":"Milan Peschel","role":"Tur Tur","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3E9GchiOTtdEIvZ3AP5cCzXaFNy.jpg"},{"id":37034,"name":"Rick Kavanian","role":"Wilde 13 / Pirate","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5UoSAiSfWT9SXTUuqItOoNhQ8Sk.jpg"},{"id":682,"name":"Uwe Ochsenknecht","role":"King Alfons","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mlNKDWmAxUIqLT4ZfW1REo7MoOD.jpg"},{"id":5649,"name":"Christoph Maria Herbst","role":"Mr. Ärmel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8v3lDa0QCJlDtOx9flqlMNIA3uf.jpg"},{"id":2018042,"name":"Leighanne Esperanzate","role":"Li Si","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2IXDgEJJbRQNd6zg4wGzLu6rbo.jpg"},{"id":2018043,"name":"Eden Gough","role":"Ping Pong","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/liDKbgXYPvIc3XxZbadYrh7VeW4.jpg"},{"id":1052284,"name":"Volker Michalowski","role":"Mailman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v6Q6U2Y74fPnJspnIymzI6EgeIq.jpg"},{"id":18072,"name":"Michael Herbig","role":"Nepumuk (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/93PW1NGTkcYxgCfPfd0m4xa7rHJ.jpg"},{"id":54678,"name":"Sonja Gerhardt","role":"Sursulapitschi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zedAqinQDd86ttW97rgGprHjbZT.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Le avventure di Jim Bottone","overview":"Nuove avventure attendono Jim Bottone e il macchinista Lukas. Dopo che i due hanno sconfitto il Drago Dorato della Saggezza, la banda dei Tredici Pirati è alla ricerca di vendetta. Con le loro locomotive Emma e Molly, Jim e Lukas intraprendono un viaggio pericoloso durante il quale Jim potrebbe finalmente vedere avverato il suo desiderio di scoprire le proprie origini."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Jim Button and the Wild 13","overview":"A year has gone by since Jim Button and his best friend, the engine driver Luke, returned from their dangerous adventure in Dragon City. Life on Morrowland goes its leisurely way again. Suddenly, dark clouds are gathering over the tranquil island of Morrowland: the notorious pirate gang \"The Wild 13\" has learned that the dragon Mrs Grindtooth has been conquered by Jim and Luke and now swears revenge.  To protect Morrowland from another threat, the two of them set off with their steam engines Emma and Molly on a dangerous journey where they meet old friends like princess Li Si, Mr. Tur Tur and Nepomuk and make new friends with Sursulapichi, a real mermaid. On their adventure, Jim's most fervent wish might also come true: to find out the truth about his mysterious origins."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Ein neues Abenteuer für Jim Knopf und Lokführer Lukas. Ein Jahr nach den Ereignissen geht das Leben in Lummerland wieder seinen gewohnten Gang. Doch es ziehen dunkle Wolken über der beschaulichen Insel auf: Die Wilde 13 hat erfahren, dass Frau Malzahn besiegt wurde, und will dafür nun Rache nehmen. Die Einwohner von Lummerland ahnen noch nichts von der drohenden Gefahr. Währenddessen ist Prinzessin Li Si bei Jim Knopf zu Besuch. Ihr kann Jim sein größtes Geheimnis anvertrauen: Er möchte endlich die Wahrheit über seine Herkunft erfahren.  Um das Geheimnis zu lüften und Lummerland vor einer weiteren Bedrohung zu beschützen, machen sich die Helden gemeinsam mit den Dampflokomotiven Emma und Molly auf den Weg in ein gefährliches Abenteuer."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9AgM7yR2utMYKRcqD1ZcAlX2ZFD.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9AgM7yR2utMYKRcqD1ZcAlX2ZFD.png","language":"xx","width":791,"height":381},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nNEVO4IZKSsFTzkRNNQfxxxiGHH.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nNEVO4IZKSsFTzkRNNQfxxxiGHH.png","language":"de","width":1200,"height":700}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xfOtvgVvDBymg97K24v4aM9OQbG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xfOtvgVvDBymg97K24v4aM9OQbG.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ySWayaStxjpTXuwyRdKrPkicBFI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ySWayaStxjpTXuwyRdKrPkicBFI.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mCEtA9sSwAlr5Xlq6QOukAYBDjS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mCEtA9sSwAlr5Xlq6QOukAYBDjS.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5YCeXXeB6GpsALoSoojc4kVPx8j.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5YCeXXeB6GpsALoSoojc4kVPx8j.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yh2IY8A6CtC1YSHcjKKIl7TcRyY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yh2IY8A6CtC1YSHcjKKIl